exit: 0
--- stdout
Serve a live preview (a file) or the playground (a directory)

Usage: executable serve [OPTIONS] [PATH]

Arguments:
  [PATH]  A .lini file (live-reload preview) or a directory (playground); omitted → the current directory

Options:
      --port <PORT>            Port to bind (default 7700) [default: 7700]
      --static                 Bake CSS variables and outline text (for non-browser renderers)
      --theme <NAME|FILE|A/B>  A theme for every served compile: a built-in name, a CSS file of `--lini-*` overrides, or a light/dark pair. See `lini theme`
  -h, --help                   Print help

--- stderr
